Learnova Alembic Database Migrations
====================================

This directory contains version-controlled database migrations managed by Alembic.
The database URL is resolved dynamically from `app.core.config.settings`.
Target metadata is bound to `app.db.base.Base.metadata`.

To create a new migration:
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description_of_change"

To apply migrations:
    alembic upgrade head

To roll back one migration:
    alembic downgrade -1
